or Ionesco The Critic  Kenneth Tynan famously once said once  you've seen all of the in esko's plays  you have seen one of them which is  absurd but true just like absurdism  absurdism suits comedy in fact because  the best comedy is essentially absurdist  and perhaps this is why absurdism will  never really go away  you
 

